    {"type":"text","id":"rec_text","x":102,"y":784,"width":1456,"height":88,"text":"✔  Go with Option C (Hybrid) — hits all four goals, stays git-light, and is the most skill-shaped.\n/capi-release  runs  bump → build → manifest → tag → cache  in one command;  /capi-rollback  redeploys the cache or rebuilds from the tag.\nSafe parallel dev = vNext on a branch (worktrees trip the psgc/roster compile trap).  First vNext piece → suppress MenuApp's entry + rename to \"Login - vX (date)\".","originalText":"x","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#065f46","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500002,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.4}
